on your taskbar in the corner of your screen. While you work or study, your Traymon keep the adventure going — just drop by now and then to look after their growth.What's in the DemoHatch and collect: Hatch the eggs you find on your adventures and meet","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:09:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694385","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5045040-1846651706672900","game_id":"steam-5045040","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Post-Launch Improvements","summary":"Hello Tamers, this is Kniv Studio.Here's a roundup of what we've been improving since launch, based on the feedback you've sent us.Much faster hatching: Egg hatch times have been greatly reduced to suit the demo.Skill rework: Monster skills — previously implemented in a fairly uniform way — have been reworked for more variety, and their descriptions have been improved.Display scale: You can now set the display scale at startup and in the settings menu.Naming: You can now give each of your Traymo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T01:45:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672900","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5045040-1845383656376516","game_id":"steam-5045040","kind":"announcement","title":"Traymon World Demo Out Now!","summary":"Hello, Tamers!The Traymon World demo is now live.✨ What's in the demo12 small, adorable monsters you can raise in the corner of your desktopCharms with a variety of options to power up your monstersChapter 1 fields, accompanied by relaxing BGMWe'll keep adding new features and monsters to the demo.Follow our official Discord Server for upda